      "user_title": "Chief Justice",
      "title_is_group": false,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>We have a print run of Spirit Island on a train in New Mexico (as of this morning). It'll be out to stores around Origins I'd guess, based on my past experience with the distributor/retailer supply chain. It is entirely sold out to distibutors, so if you see it in stores this summer, pick it up right away!</p><p>There is *another* print run that is about to leave China. I'd guess that it is likely to be in stores around Labor Day, and it is *also* nearly sold out to distributors (even though it is bigger than the closer print run).</p><p>We're anticipating having yet another print run in stores for Thanksgiving / end of year holidays.</p>",
